OL,3,GNEWSAMayor buys late woman's artwork
OL,4,Athen returns it to family
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artwork started by a 22-year-old
OL,7,Fwoman before her death has been bought
OL,8,Ffor #2,000 - and then given back to her
OL,9,Ffamily.
OL,11,FFrancesca McCaigue, known as Fran, had
OL,12,Fcomplex congenital heart disease and
OL,13,Fhad been supported by Derian House
OL,14,FChildren's Hospice in Chorley,
OL,15,FLancashire, since she was eight.
OL,17,FShe died in hospital on 6 July, with
OL,18,Fher sister Chloe beside her, before she
OL,19,Fwas able to finish the artwork she had
OL,20,Fbegun for the hospice's charity ball.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
