OL,3,GNEWSAMayor buys late woman's artwork
OL,4,Athen returns it to family
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter hearing Fran's story at the ball,
OL,7,Fthe Mayor of Blackburn with Darwen,
OL,8,FCouncillor Mahfooz Hussain, made the
OL,9,Fwinning #2,000 bid before giving the
OL,10,Fartwork back to her family.
